    <string name="about_body"><![CDATA[
<b>TS3 Mobile</b>　version %1$s<br/><br/>
This app is a modification of the <a href="https://github.com/EchoSixHIYA/WebSpeak-client-for-TeamSpeak">WebSpeak</a> code base: the repository and some of the design are shared, while this client is a native Android implementation that connects to a TeamSpeak server directly.<br/><br/>
<b>It is not authorised by WebSpeak.</b> It has no affiliation with, or endorsement from, the original project or its authors, and does not represent their position. For official support, use the build published by the original project.<br/><br/>
<b>Thanks to</b><br/>
<a href="https://github.com/lishang999">github.com/lishang999</a><br/>
<a href="https://github.com/akatsuki-misaki">github.com/akatsuki-misaki</a><br/>
<a href="https://github.com/Tungsten-Owl">github.com/Tungsten-Owl</a><br/>
<a href="https://github.com/hyb-oyqq">github.com/hyb-oyqq</a><br/><br/>
<b>Special thanks</b><br/>
<a href="https://space.bilibili.com/38556474">space.bilibili.com/38556474</a><br/>
<a href="https://space.bilibili.com/38958171">space.bilibili.com/38958171</a><br/><br/>
<b>Projects</b><br/>
<a href="https://github.com/HoneyBBQ/teamspeak-js">HoneyBBQ/teamspeak-js</a><br/>
<a href="https://github.com/EchoSixHIYA/WebSpeak-client-for-TeamSpeak">EchoSixHIYA/WebSpeak-client-for-TeamSpeak</a><br/><br/>
The bundled AI denoisers come from their own open-source projects; their licences travel with the model files.
]]></string>
